274	  - `.env` parsing: `#` comments, blank lines, optional single or double quotes, no interpolation;
275	  - process environment overrides the file;
276	  - a missing required key raises `ConfigError` naming the key;
277	  - `http`/`https` URLs are accepted, and `file:`, `ftp:`, `data:` and schemeless URLs are refused;
278	  - the pin constants equal `qwen3.5:4b`, `d8b0f5e9760c`, `0.32.14` and `Q4_K_M`;
279	  - the generation constants are temperature 0.1, seed 42, num_predict 700, think false, format `"json"`, timeout 300, max attempts 3, backoff `[5, 10]`;
280	  - `num_ctx` gives 4096 at `prompt_chars` 0 and 8652, and 4097 at 8655 (formula `max(4096, n // 3 + 700 + 512)`);
