293	  - for each R-1 keyword (`type` including type lists, `enum`, `const`, `properties`, `required`, `additionalProperties`, `items`, `minItems`, `maxItems`, `uniqueItems`, `minLength`, `pattern`, `exclusiveMinimum`, `maxProperties`, `anyOf`, `allOf`, `if`/`then`, local `$ref`), one conforming and one non-conforming document;
