296	  - against `output.schema.json`:
297	    - the AC-1.1 result validates;
298	    - each FR-015 status shape is enforced: extracted with non-empty `missing_fields`, needs_clarification with empty `missing_fields`, not_an_order with a non-null `order`, and rejected with non-empty `evidence` or a null `rejection_reason` all fail;
