324	  - `get_json` builds `GET {OLLAMA_URL}/api/version`;
325	  - `build_opener()` contains only `HTTPHandler`, `HTTPSHandler`, `HTTPDefaultErrorHandler` and `HTTPErrorProcessor`, and opening a `file:`, `ftp:` or `data:` URL with it raises `URLError` without touching a socket.
